e:["$","span",null,{"children":"Hampton Roads is the harbor where the James, Elizabeth, and Nansemond rivers meet the Chesapeake Bay. The former Gosport Navy Yard is now Norfolk Naval Shipyard in Portsmouth. Newport News Point, Sewell’s Point, and Fort Monroe define the approaches to the 1862 battlefield."}]
